AGENT SKILL BUNDLES — UPSTREAM ATTRIBUTION

Tau ships a generated API corpus with each CAD kernel package, under that
package's `agent/` directory and aggregated for adoption by `@taucad/skills`.
Every corpus is derived from an upstream project's declared public surface:
symbol names, signatures, and — except for Open CASCADE — documentation
comments. Those corpora are derivative works of their upstream sources and
carry the attributions below. The licence review recording the source of truth
for each entry is
`docs/research/artifacts/multi-language-api-extraction-substrate/licence-review.md`.

